itle":"Un centro especializado en adicciones, con <span style=\"color:#045CB4;\">historia<\/span> y criterio propio","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Instrument Serif","typography_font_size":{"size":2.7999999999999998,"unit":"rem"},"typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_style":"italic","typography_line_height":{"size":1.1499999999999999,"unit":"em"},"title_color":"#031830","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"28","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"450934ea","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"editor":"<p>Emerae naci\u00f3 de m\u00e1s de dos d\u00e9cadas trabajando con personas y familias en el campo de las adicciones en Barcelona. No de un proyecto empresarial \u2014 sino de la experiencia acumulada de quienes llevan a\u00f1os en esto.<\/p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Inter","typography_font_size":{"size":0.94999999999999996,"unit":"rem"},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"size":1.75,"unit":"em"},"text_color":"#4a5a6a","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"18","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"26131d2c","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"editor":"<p>No somos un centro generalista que tambi\u00e9n trata adicciones. Es nuestra \u00fanica especialidad \u2014 porque creemos que la especializaci\u00f3n no es un valor a\u00f1adido, es la base de cualquier tratamiento serio.<\/p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Inter","typography_font_size":{"size":0.94999999999999996,"unit":"rem"},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"size":1.75,"unit":"em"},"text_color":"#4a5a6a","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"4855e247","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"html":"<div style=\"background:#031830;border-radius:14px;padding:28px 32px;margin-top:32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\r\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#045CB4,#BDDAE8);\"><\/div>\r\n  <p style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.88rem;color:rgba(189,218,232,0.85);line-height:1.7;margin:0;font-weight:300;\">\r\n    En el campo de las adicciones existe mucho intrusismo. En Emerae todos los tratamientos est\u00e1n dirigidos y supervisados por <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;\">psic\u00f3logas, terapeutas y especialistas con formaci\u00f3n acreditada<\/strong>. De ello depende la seguridad y la eficacia del proceso.\r\n  <\/p>\r\n<\/div>","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout"}},{"id":"37f136aa","elType":"container","isInner":true,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","width":{"size":50,"unit":"%"},"gap":{"size":0,"unit":"px"}},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[{"id":"2feccf3","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"html":"<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7a8a9a;margin-bottom:24px;\"><span style=\"display:block;width:16px;height:1.5px;background:#7a8a9a;\"><\/span>Nuestros valores<\/div>"},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}},{"id":"1b0c1e06","elType":"widget","isInner":false,"isLocked":false,"settings":{"html":"<div style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<div style=\"padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(3,24,48,0.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(3,24,48,0.08);display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#045CB4;font-weight:400;padding-top:3px;\">01<\/span>\n  <div><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin:0 0 6px 0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Confidencialidad total<\/p><p style=\"font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;margin:0;font-weight:300;\">Cada proceso es estrictamente privado. Lo que se trabaja en consulta permanece en consulta.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(3,24,48,0.08);display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#045CB4;font-weight:400;padding-top:3px;\">02<\/span>\n  <div><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin:0 0 6px 0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Enfoque no moralizante<\/p><p style=\"font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;margin:0;font-weight:300;\">No venimos a juzgar. Venimos a acompa\u00f1ar. La adicci\u00f3n no es un defecto de car\u00e1cter.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(3,24,48,0.08);display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#045CB4;font-weight:400;padding-top:3px;\">03<\/span>\n  <div><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin:0 0 6px 0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Rigor cl\u00ednico<\/p><p style=\"font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;margin:0;font-weight:300;\">Metodolog\u00edas con evidencia cient\u00edfica, actualizadas y adaptadas a cada caso.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(3,24,48,0.08);display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#045CB4;font-weight:400;padding-top:3px;\">04<\/span>\n  <div><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:#031830;margin:0 0 6px 0;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Presencia real<\/p><p style=\"font-size:0.82rem;color:#7a8a9a;line-height:1.65;margin:0;font-weight:300;\">Hay personas concretas y accesibles que conocen tu caso. No somos un call center ni una plataforma digital.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>"},"defaultEditSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"},"interactions":[],"elements":[],"widgetType":"html","editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"content"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout"}}],"editSettings":{"defaultEditRoute":"layout","panel":{"activeTab":"layout","activeSection":"section_layout_container"}}}],"page_settings":{"template":"default"},"version":"0.4","title":"7.PORQUE_EMERAE","type":"container"}